:"Le serveur a apporté deux bols de nouilles.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"短":{"c":"短","pinyin":"duǎn","lectures":["duǎn"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["矢","豆"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L2-0140","L2-0141","L3-0161","L3-0162","L3-0163","L4-0692","L6-0100","L6-0237","L7-0952","L7-0953","L7-1996","L7-4917"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"court","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"court, bref"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"她的头发很短。","pinyin":"Tā de tóufa hěn duǎn.","fr":"Elle a les cheveux courts.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi dit que pour juger du long et du court, on prenait la flèche pour étalon : 矢, avec 豆 pour le son. On lit toujours 矢 à gauche et 豆 à droite. 豆 se lit dòu : il ne donne plus le son de duǎn.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi says that to judge long and short, the arrow was the standard: 矢, with 豆 for the sound. You still read 矢 on the left and 豆 on the right. 豆 is read dòu: it no longer gives the sound of duǎn.","roles":{"矢":"sens","豆":"forme"}}},"断":{"c":"断","pinyin":"duàn","lectures":["duàn"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["𠃊","米","斤"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L3-0057","L3-0164","L3-0527","L5-0987","L5-1022","L6-0180","L7-0955","L7-0956","L7-0957","L7-1521","L7-2012","L7-2705","L7-3300","L7-4190","L7-5149"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"casser, rompre ; couper","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"se casser, se rompre"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"couper, interrompre"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他的腿断了。","pinyin":"Tā de tuǐ duàn le.","fr":"Il s'est cassé la jambe.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"电话断了。","pinyin":"Diànhuà duàn le.","fr":"La communication a été coupée.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"段":{"c":"段","pinyin":"duàn","lectures":["duàn"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["⿷⿻𠂆一二","殳"],"sources":["surcharge"]},"mots":["L2-0142","L4-0399","L5-0698","L7-0832","L7-0954","L7-2719","L7-3118","L7-3699"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"segment, passage ; période","acceptions":[{"categorie":"M","fr":"classificateur des segments : passage, période, tronçon"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这段路很难走。","pinyin":"Zhè duàn lù hěn nán zǒu.","fr":"Ce tronçon de route est difficile.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"请读这一段。","pinyin":"Qǐng dú zhè yī duàn.","fr":"Lisez ce passage, s'il vous plaît.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi glose 段 par « frapper un objet » et l'écrit avec 殳, l'outil qui frappe. À gauche, la norme nomme 段字旁 d'après lui ; à droite, 殳. Ce qu'on frappe se casse en morceaux : 段 compte les sections, les passages, les périodes.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi glosses 段 as “to hammer something” and writes it with 殳, the striking tool. On the left, the standard names 段字旁 after it; on the right, 殳. What is hammered breaks into pieces: 段 counts sections, passages and periods.","roles":{"⿷⿻𠂆一二":"forme","殳":"sens"}}},"锻":{"c":"锻","pinyin":"duàn","lectures":["duàn"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["钅","⿷⿻𠂆一二","殳"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L4-0205"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"forger","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"forger le métal"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"堆":{"c":"堆","pinyin":"duī","lectures":["duī","zuī"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["土","隹"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0215","L7-0958"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"entasser ; tas ; un tas de","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"entasser, empiler"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"tas, monceau"},{"categorie":"M","fr":"classificateur : un tas de"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"桌子上堆着一堆书。","pinyin":"Zhuōzi shang duī zhe yī duī shū.","fr":"Des livres s'entassent sur la table.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"兑":{"c":"兑","pinyin":"duì","lectures":["duì"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["丷","口","儿"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0969","L7-0970"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"échanger, convertir","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"échanger, convertir"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"对":{"c":"对","pinyin":"duì","lectures":["duì"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["又","寸"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L1-0031","L1-0092","L1-0093","L2-0145","L2-0146","L2-0147","L3-0166","L3-0167","L3-0168","L3-0169","L3-0180","L3-0404","L3-0488","L4-0206","L4-0207","L4-0208","L4-0941","L5-0216","L5-0217","L6-0239","L6-0240","L6-0578","L6-0981","L7-0960","L7-0961","L7-0962","L7-0963","L7-0964","L7-0965","L7-0966","L7-0967","L7-0968","L7-1632","L7-2832","L7-4517","L7-4518","L7-5291","L7-5628"],"chemin":{"hsk":95,"lire":93},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"juste, en face, envers","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"你说得对。","pinyin":"Nǐ shuō de duì.","fr":"Tu as raison.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"他对我很好。","pinyin":"Tā duì wǒ hěn hǎo.","fr":"Il est très gentil avec moi.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"mnemotechnique","fr":"Pour s'en souvenir : deux mains côte à côte, 又 et 寸, l'une face à l'autre. Ce qui se fait face se répond et va par paire : c'est ce que dit 对, « en face, répondre, juste ». Dans la forme simplifiée, 又 remplace la partie gauche, plus complexe, de l'ancien 對.","en":"A way to remember it: two hands side by side, 又 and 寸, facing each other. Things that face each other answer each other and come in pairs, which is what 对 says: “opposite”, “to answer”, “correct”. In the simplified form, 又 replaces the more complex left side of the old 對.","roles":{"又":"forme","寸":"sens"}}},"队":{"c":"队","pinyin":"duì","lectures":["duì"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["阝","人"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L2-0143","L2-0144","L2-0408","L2-0448","L3-0165","L3-0873","L6-0075","L6-0238","L6-0490","L6-0825","L7-0451","L7-0696","L7-0728","L7-0876","L7-0959","L7-2496","L7-2664"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"équipe ; file","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"équipe"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"file, queue"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他是我们队的。","pinyin":"Tā shì wǒmen duì de.","fr":"Il fait partie de notre équipe.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi écrit 隊 et le glose « tomber d'en haut » : 阝, le talus, et 㒸 pour le son. Ce sens est passé à 墜, et 隊 a pris celui de « rang, troupe ». La forme simplifiée garde 阝 et y met 人 : des gens alignés.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi writes 隊 and glosses it as “to fall from a height”: 阝, the bank, and 㒸 for the sound. That meaning moved to 墜, and 隊 took on “rank, troop”. The simplified form keeps 阝 and puts 人 beside it: people in a line.","roles":{"阝":"forme","人":"sens"}}},"吨":{"c":"吨","pinyin":"dūn","lectures":["dūn"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["口","屯"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0218"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"tonne","acceptions":[{"categorie":"M","fr":"tonne"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这辆车能拉五吨货。","pinyin":"Zhè liàng chē néng lā wǔ dūn huò.","fr":"Ce camion peut transporter cinq tonnes de marchandises.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"敦":{"c":"敦","pinyin":"dūn","lectures":["dūn","duì"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["亠","口","子","𠂉","乂"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0971","L7-0972"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"sincère, honnête ; exhorter","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"sincère, honnête"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"exhorter, presser"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"蹲":{"c":"蹲","pinyin":"dūn","lectures":["dūn","cún"],"niveau":6,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["口","止","丷","酉","寸"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L6-0241"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"s'accroupir ; rester, croupir","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"s'accroupir"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"rester, croupir quelque part"}]},"exemples":[{"z